pan></span><strong>Authorized Administrator</strong><small>Job Portal Management System</small></div><div class="approved-seal">SELECTED<br><b>✓</b></div></div><footer class="letter-footer">Academic Project · Department of CSE, SEU · Developed by Syed Asaduzzaman & Syed Zulker Nayeem</footer></article></body></html>
